  "description": "Unpredictable! What will be the ending of this heart-pounding feeling?\n\nWhen she gets a “hunch,” she’s right 100% of the time!\n\nBoyoung, known as the “master of hunches,” is a couple manager who ranks first in matching success thanks to her almost supernatural sixth sense.\n\nBut, as the saying goes, “a monk can’t shave his own head.” Her own love life fails again and again. On top of that, because those hunches come to her anytime and anywhere, people often treat her like a strange person. That is why her first meeting with Eungi was, in short, a complete disaster.\n\nA handsome face, but a personality that doesn’t match.\n\nEungi, famous as a divorce lawyer, does not believe in love, which he considers nothing more than an empty emotion, after witnessing the unhappy end of his parents’ marriage during his childhood.\n\nThen, while handling a divorce case, Eungi is attacked by a stranger and loses his memory. When he sees Boyoung, who comes to visit him at the hospital, his heart begins to race like crazy.\n\nWhen his memories suddenly return upon seeing her, Eungi starts looking for her every day, using his memory as an excuse. However, at the same time, he hurls cruel words at her, saying that “once he regains his memory, this heart-pounding feeling will disappear too”...\n\nWhat will be the ending of this romance that began by chance?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68913399), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%96%B4%EC%A9%8C%EB%8B%A4-%EB%A7%88%EC%A3%BC%EC%B9%9C-%EB%A1%9C%EB%A7%A8%EC%8A%A4/4839)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/gp/product/B0DL66D2G7)",
